it. This PR adds a bounded observer to find how much CPU the current own-checkpoint reader spends decoding, recomputing scores, and doing the remaining checkpoint work.\n\nThe implementation preserves all 433 scientific source files and binds three private observer files separately. Only the archive reader's named callsite starts a timing region. Nested costs are separated without double counting, original results/errors/aliases are preserved, and failed runs retain partial records. Saved reports can be regenerated into a fresh output folder.\n\n**Source checks complete:** source `899ad05`, 436-file fingerprint `81ea769018500d50c2dfcc48b0ced099d6fe424c8cff7f235540f14620da32ca`. Both local bases pass 4,801 tests (65 skipped, 150 deselected); both relevant optional suites pass 1,704. [Both hosted source jobs passed](https://github.com/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/actions/runs/43844976093), with actual Python/NumPy, every uv selection and the complete tested tree verified. [All six records and tested operators were published](https://github.com/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/blob/67b8b82d93b25d853e02ceb2e2f7e7337888c1f5/results/checkpoint-replay-cpu/checks.json) before formal collection. Earlier development failures and the superseded local cohort remain in the history.\n\n**Own-only proof published and verified:** [raw evidence at `0533b61`](https://github.com/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/blob/0533b61e55d8df385d265b5765c914e1bc9b9cb5/results/checkpoint-replay-cpu/software-raw-manifest.json). Eight actual tiny checkpoint cases, three reads / 72 selected calls, independent error 0.0, exact original/instrumented results and complete restoration. Whole CLI 0.9871026249893475 seconds, within 180. No reference was constructed during this proof.\n\n**Running:** the single registered ordinary/profiled complete cost-audit pair. Each child retains 900 seconds, with 1,800 shared; all original reads, source/publication/license checks and three reference workers remain. The source and Git head stay fixed during collection. All raw/partial/failing evidence will be published before analysis; no favorable retry or smaller workload.\n\nNo Hold'em training, stronger strategy or production-cost admission is claimed. The old budget and accuracy failures remain. The PR stays open through the report and final local/hosted checks.\n\n[Prospective plan](https://github.com/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/issues/4#issuecomment-6910138688) · [Method](https://github.com/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/blob/0533b61e55d8df385d265b5765c914e1bc9b9cb5/docs/checkpoint-replay-cpu.md) · [Learning journal, step 126](https://github.com/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/blob/0533b61e55d8df385d265b5765c914e1bc9b9cb5/docs/learning-journal.md#126-check-the-tool-before-timing-checkpoint-replay)\n\nRefs #4.","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-16T10:00:56Z","updated_at":"2026-11-16T11:08:33Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"c37eb5514b44d7f77ce9dfa095cdfb9c0581620e","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"jimmy-sim:research/checkpoint-observer","ref":"research/checkpoint-observer","repo":{"id":1444975151,"node_id":"R_kgDOViCSLw","name":"poker-ai","full_name":"jimmy-sim/poker-ai","owner":{"login":"jimmy-sim","id":77947780,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3OTQ3Nzgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77947780?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jimmy-sim","html_url":"https://github.com/jimmy-sim","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jimmy-sim/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jimmy-sim/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jimmy-sim/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jimmy-sim/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jimmy-sim/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jimmy-sim/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jimmy-sim/repos","events_url":"https:/